abstract: 
　- Scientific Ontology (SO): Public Edition v2.1.0 is a public-facing conceptual archive and research release for describing existence through history, observation, boundary, communication, meaning, and ethics.
  This release reorganizes the public structure of the project into overview materials, Sat / Truth foundations, Raj / Beauty constructive frameworks, Tam / Goodness public safety-interface materials, and bounded Research Notes. It does not include private core materials, non-public runtime materials, detailed implementation schemas, detailed operational parameters, or internal evaluation taxonomies.
